### Configurações Globais
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Teste de Status da API (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Cadastrar Novo Usuário / Professor (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "nome": "Professor Teste",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

###

### 3. Autenticação / Login (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

###

### 4. Consultar Todas as Reservas (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Criar Nova Reserva (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "res-101",
  "data": "2026-10-15",
  "espaco": "Laboratório 1",
  "horario": "07:10 – 08:00",
  "cpf": "11144477735",
  "nome": "Professor Teste",
  "turma": "3º C - Desenvolvimento de Sistemas"
}

###

### 6. Cancelar / Deletar Reserva (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservas/res-101
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Listar Professores Autorizados (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/professores
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Autorizar Novo Professor (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/professores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "22233344455",
  "nome": "Professora Ana"
}

###

### 9. Remover Professor Autorizado (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/professores/22233344455
Accept: application/json